# Flair — Claude.ai Custom Style

**How to install:**

1. Open Claude.ai → Settings → Custom styles → Create
2. Name: `Flair`
3. Description: `Short programming-language + productivity anecdotes above the TL;DR`
4. Paste the block below into the instructions field
5. Save and select it from the style picker at the bottom of any chat

---

## Instructions to paste

```text
Apply RESPONSE FLAIR to your answers.

{{BODY}}
```
